abstract: >-
  Academic exploratory data analysis project for the transcribed locomotive
  Data Logger records in Tables 6-10 of KNKT Final Report KNKT.26.04.03.02.
  The repository documents data provenance, quality checks, descriptive
  analysis, visualizations, and reproducible workflows. It does not establish
  accident causation.
